#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.6"
msgstr "v4.1.6"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.6 is a maintenance and examples release that refreshes all bundled "
"board firmware to OpenMV firmware 4.5.3, reorganizes the OpenMV Boards "
"examples by board family, and adds new autofocus, color-correction, Pure "
"Thermal, and OpenMV RT1060 example sets. The release remains based on Qt "
"Creator 10.0.1 (no rebase) and contains no breaking changes for user "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.6 es una versión de mantenimiento y de ejemplos que actualiza todo el "
"firmware de placa incluido al firmware de OpenMV 4.5.3, reorganiza los "
"ejemplos de OpenMV Boards por familia de placas y añade nuevos conjuntos de "
"ejemplos de autoenfoque, corrección de color, Pure Thermal y OpenMV RT1060. "
"La versión sigue basándose en Qt Creator 10.0.1 (sin rebase) y no contiene "
"cambios incompatibles para los proyectos de usuario."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "En esta página"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Aspectos destacados"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:20
msgid ""
"**OpenMV firmware 4.5.3** is now bundled, with board firmware (and, for the "
"STM32 OpenMV cameras, bootloader/uvc) images rebuilt for the OpenMV and "
"Arduino boards."
msgstr ""
"El **firmware de OpenMV 4.5.3** ahora está incluido, con las imágenes de "
"firmware de placa (y, para las cámaras OpenMV STM32, de bootloader/uvc) "
"reconstruidas para las placas OpenMV y Arduino."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Reorganized OpenMV Boards examples** into ``50-STM32-Boards``, ``50-IMXRT-"
"Boards``, ``51-Pure-Thermal``, and ``60-Shields`` subfolders with per-board "
"filtering so each board only sees relevant examples."
msgstr ""
"**Ejemplos de OpenMV Boards reorganizados** en las subcarpetas "
"``50-STM32-Boards``, ``50-IMXRT-Boards``, ``51-Pure-Thermal`` y "
"``60-Shields`` con filtrado por placa, de modo que cada placa solo vea los "
"ejemplos relevantes."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Pure Thermal examples** added, including a thermal-over-color overlay demo"
" driving the LCD and HDMI output."
msgstr ""
"**Ejemplos de Pure Thermal** añadidos, incluida una demostración de "
"superposición térmica sobre color que controla la salida LCD y HDMI."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:28
msgid ""
"**OpenMV RT1060 board-control examples** added under a new ``50-IMXRT-"
"Boards`` set."
msgstr ""
"**Ejemplos de control de placa de OpenMV RT1060** añadidos en un nuevo "
"conjunto ``50-IMXRT-Boards``."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Sensor autofocus** and **color-correction** examples added, demonstrating "
"``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)`` and the image ``ccm()`` "
"color correction matrix method."
msgstr ""
"Ejemplos de **autoenfoque del sensor** y de **corrección de color** "
"añadidos, que demuestran ``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)`` y"
" el método de matriz de corrección de color ``ccm()`` de la imagen."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:35
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nuevas funciones"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:37
msgid ""
"Added a **sensor autofocus** example demonstrating "
"``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)`` for cameras that support "
"autofocus (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se añadió un ejemplo de **autoenfoque del sensor** que demuestra "
"``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)`` para cámaras compatibles "
"con autoenfoque (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:41
msgid ""
"Added a **color-correction** example showing the new image ``ccm()`` color "
"correction matrix method for hue/saturation shifts via YUV matrix math, "
"using ``ulab`` numpy (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se añadió un ejemplo de **corrección de color** que muestra el nuevo método "
"de matriz de corrección de color ``ccm()`` de la imagen para desplazamientos"
" de tono/saturación mediante cálculo de matrices YUV, usando ``ulab`` numpy "
"(`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:45
msgid ""
"Added a full set of **Pure Thermal** board examples, including a thermal-"
"over-color overlay demo driving the LCD and HDMI output via "
"``fir.FIR_LEPTON``, ``display.RGBDisplay``, and ``tfp410.TFP410``, plus "
"blinky and helloworld (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se añadió un conjunto completo de ejemplos de placa **Pure Thermal**, "
"incluida una demostración de superposición térmica sobre color que controla "
"la salida LCD y HDMI mediante ``fir.FIR_LEPTON``, ``display.RGBDisplay`` y "
"``tfp410.TFP410``, además de blinky y helloworld (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:50
msgid ""
"Added a dedicated **50-IMXRT-Boards** example set for the OpenMV RT1060 with"
" ADC, CAN, I2C, LED/PWM, motor control, pin, PWM, RTC, servo, SPI, switch, "
"timer, UART, and watchdog board-control scripts (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se añadió un conjunto de ejemplos dedicado **50-IMXRT-Boards** para la "
"OpenMV RT1060 con scripts de control de placa para ADC, CAN, I2C, LED/PWM, "
"control de motores, pin, PWM, RTC, servo, SPI, switch, temporizador, UART y "
"watchdog (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:56
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Otros cambios y mejoras"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:58
msgid ""
"Updated all bundled board firmware to **OpenMV firmware 4.5.3**, rebuilding "
"the firmware images for the OpenMV and Arduino boards (with bootloader and "
"uvc images rebuilt only for the STM32 OpenMV cameras) (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se actualizó todo el firmware de placa incluido al **firmware de OpenMV "
"4.5.3**, reconstruyendo las imágenes de firmware para las placas OpenMV y "
"Arduino (con las imágenes de bootloader y uvc reconstruidas solo para las "
"cámaras OpenMV STM32) (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:62
msgid ""
"Reorganized the OpenMV Boards examples into ``50-STM32-Boards``, ``50-IMXRT-"
"Boards``, ``51-Pure-Thermal``, and ``60-Shields`` subfolders with per-board "
"filtering, moving many board-control and shield scripts into the appropriate"
" family (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se reorganizaron los ejemplos de OpenMV Boards en las subcarpetas "
"``50-STM32-Boards``, ``50-IMXRT-Boards``, ``51-Pure-Thermal`` y "
"``60-Shields`` con filtrado por placa, trasladando muchos scripts de control"
" de placa y de shields a la familia correspondiente (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:67
msgid ""
"Hid the HelloWorld blinky/helloworld examples on the Pure Thermal board and "
"added STM32 low-power examples (``deep_sleep``, ``sensor_sleep``, "
"``stop_mode``) (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se ocultaron los ejemplos blinky/helloworld de HelloWorld en la placa Pure "
"Thermal y se añadieron ejemplos de bajo consumo de STM32 (``deep_sleep``, "
"``sensor_sleep``, ``stop_mode``) (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:71
msgid ""
"Removed the ``cartoon_filter`` example and dropped the ``person_detection`` "
"built-in-model callback from the RPC Remote-Control popular-features "
"examples (``08-RPC-Library/34-Remote-Control``), following removal of the "
"bundled ``person_detection`` model in firmware 4.5.3, and updated several "
"recording, drawing, WiFi, and MQTT examples (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se eliminó el ejemplo ``cartoon_filter`` y se quitó la función de retorno "
"(callback) del modelo integrado ``person_detection`` de los ejemplos de "
"funciones populares de RPC Remote-Control (``08-RPC-Library/34-Remote-"
"Control``), tras la eliminación del modelo ``person_detection`` incluido en "
"el firmware 4.5.3, y se actualizaron varios ejemplos de grabación, dibujo, "
"WiFi y MQTT (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:79
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrección de errores"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:81
msgid ""
"Fixed the Chinese (``zh_CN`` and ``zh_TW``) \"All Files\" file-dialog filter"
" translation that used fullwidth characters, restoring the working ASCII "
"``(*.*)`` pattern in Open/Save dialogs (`cecfda3b7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/cecfda3b7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Se corrigió la traducción del filtro de diálogo de archivos «All Files» en "
"chino (``zh_CN`` y ``zh_TW``) que usaba caracteres de ancho completo, "
"restaurando el patrón ASCII funcional ``(*.*)`` en los diálogos "
"Abrir/Guardar (`cecfda3b7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cecfda3b7>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:87
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Compatibilidad de plataforma y herramientas"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:89
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Base de Qt Creator:** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:90
msgid ""
"**OpenMV firmware:** updated from 4.5.2 to 4.5.3. ``OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT`` "
"received full firmware + bootloader + uvc rebuilds; "
"``ARDUINO_GIGA``/``PORTENTA_H7``/``NICLA_VISION`` received firmware + uvc; "
"``ARDUINO_NANO_RP2040_CONNECT`` and the Nano 33 BLE Sense received firmware "
"only; ``OPENMV_RT1060`` received ``firmware.bin`` only. The Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense ``boards.txt`` identifier was normalized to "
"``ARDUINO_NANO_33_BLE_SENSE``."
msgstr ""
"**Firmware de OpenMV:** actualizado de 4.5.2 a 4.5.3. ``OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT`` "
"recibieron reconstrucciones completas de firmware + bootloader + uvc; "
"``ARDUINO_GIGA``/``PORTENTA_H7``/``NICLA_VISION`` recibieron firmware + uvc;"
" ``ARDUINO_NANO_RP2040_CONNECT`` y la Nano 33 BLE Sense recibieron solo "
"firmware; ``OPENMV_RT1060`` recibió solo ``firmware.bin``. El identificador "
"``boards.txt`` de la Nano 33 BLE Sense se normalizó a "
"``ARDUINO_NANO_33_BLE_SENSE``."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:97
msgid ""
"**CYW4343 WiFi firmware:** metadata added for CYW43 WiFi FW 7.45.98.50 "
"(``CYW43_WIFI_FW_LEN`` 383110, ``CYW43_CLM_LEN`` 7222)."
msgstr ""
"**Firmware WiFi CYW4343:** se añadieron metadatos para el FW WiFi CYW43 "
"7.45.98.50 (``CYW43_WIFI_FW_LEN`` 383110, ``CYW43_CLM_LEN`` 7222)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:101
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Cambios incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:103
msgid ""
"None. This release is fully compatible with existing projects; the Qt "
"Creator base is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ninguno. Esta versión es totalmente compatible con los proyectos existentes;"
" la base de Qt Creator no ha cambiado."
